</pre>

<h3>1.4.1 Module Description</h3>
<p>The system comprises six decoupled engines: Anthropometric Nutrition Engine, Food Catalog Repository, Hard Constraint Safety Filter, Multi-Objective Ranking Engine, Plan Generator, and Adaptive Preference Controller.</p>

